घटिक, अस्, आ, अम्, crossing a river on a jar (?);
(अस्), m. a waterman; (आ), f. a water-jar, a bucket,
a pot; a period of time = 24 minutes [cf. घटी];
(according to other authorities equal to 1 Muhūrta,
i. e. 48 minutes, or = 1 Kalā); the ancle [cf. घुटिका];
(अम्), n. the hip, the posteriors.

घटित, अस्, आ, अम्, planned, devised, attempted;
happened, occurred; joined, united, connected, con-
tiguous, in contact with; produced, effected, exerted;
made, made of. घटित-त्वात्, from the taking
place, because of the occurrence.
